    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implement a SFCW radar. This version uses only one TX channel for transmitting radar pulse. A directional coupler connected to the TX port feed the copy of the transmitting pulse to the reference RX port See macro for channel definitions. Two waveforms, single tone or chirp, are supported </para>
    </detaileddescription>
